WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:05.917
1. Open Support and click New ticket.

2
00:00:05.917 --> 00:00:14.381
2. Choose the department and the service it is about.

3
00:00:14.381 --> 00:00:30.200
3. Write a short subject and what you see, then submit.

4
00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:42.188
4. Open the ticket any time to read replies and answer in the reply box.
